#: {{ux|hrx|Ich here Musik, '''wenn'''-ich aam Wegh gehn|I listen to music '''when''' I walk down the street.}}
# [[if]]
#: {{ux|hrx|'''Wenn'''-ich reich wäär, däd-ich meer en groses Haus kaafe.|'''If''' I were rich, I would buy a big house for myself.}}

